Hey Codex is a modified GPL-3.0 fork of littlemelon77/hey-claude:
  https://github.com/littlemelon77/hey-claude
Substantial portions of the original remain, including the audio capture
pipeline and the sherpa-onnx wake-word engine integration. Changes include
replacing Claude-specific behavior with a local ChatGPT Voice shortcut helper,
a rebuilt menu-bar interface, and Voice-panel state observation. The original
copyright and GPL-3.0 terms are preserved.

